    Clean up genmkfile_temp_dir on every exit path

    make_init now sets an EXIT trap (genmkfile_temp_dir_cleanup) removing the temp
    dir, so an error exit (which never reaches make_deinit under errexit) no longer
    leaks one 'mktemp --directory' per failed run. Idempotent with make_deinit;
    subshells reset the trap so it never fires mid-run.

