    Harden install residue skip and make_dist debian exclusion

    - install skip: split the path with parameter expansion, not 'read' (which stops
      at the first newline), so a residue name containing a newline is still excluded
      and never reaches the mode-fix 'stat' that would abort under errexit.
    - make_dist: exclude only './debian' and its contents, not sibling 'debian*'
      names (a 'debianrc' file, a 'debian-notes/' dir) -- matching the fix already in
      make_debinstfile_create; align the empty-directory guard with the tar find so
      an empty dir under debian/ (never tarred) does not abort 'genmkfile dist'.

