commit c21498a9ad6fdc0345e7cc8f4bce5c72009154a3
Author: claude (dev424 a62e2595-d8fe-4213-af32-c611a79e91a1) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Sat Sep 5 01:56:22 2026 -0400

    genmkfile: reconcile make_helper mode-fix (ai-review)

    - skip the mode-fix for a symlink source entirely: 'stat %a' on a
      symlink is 0777 and 'chmod' follows it, so processing an in-tree
      alias rewrote the TARGET's mode (e.g. loosening a skip-list 0600
      file, or stripping a setuid)
    - normalise to the source-declared mode instead of preserving a stale
      destination setuid: git cannot declare setuid, so keeping a stale one
      left an updated 0755 binary silently setuid-root (privilege
      escalation); maintainer scripts re-apply special bits, not genmkfile
    - rename the internal 'nogenmkfile' marker helper off the 'make_'
      prefix so the target dispatcher no longer exposes it (it crashed on
      '$1: unbound variable')

