    - deb-cleanup: drop the '-' (revision) requirement from the artifact
      globs -- the orig tarball is '<pkg>_<version>.orig.tar.xz' with no
      revision, so requiring a hyphen left every orig tarball (and native
      artifacts) behind
    - make_debinstfile_create: capture 'find | sort' via a temp with an
      explicit rc check instead of '< <(...)', which hid the producer's
      exit status (a sort failure would ship a partial .install as success)

