    git-push: fix two regressions from the cowbuilder-gate generalization

    ai-review (grok, coderabbit) found two regressions in the target classifier:
    - the '' / '--' argv arm was dropped, so `genmkfile git-push --` (or "") fell to
      the default and ran make_get_variables, aborting in a non-package repo
    - the DISTDIR exists/writable check ran for enforce=false targets on '../', so a
