Author: claude (dev163 38f9745c-aed1-4fb4-b6ae-9899f20f8de2) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Sat Aug 8 10:52:57 2026 -0400

    deb-cleanup: also strip .pytest_cache

    - The helper comment named pytest as a residue source but the find expression
      did not match .pytest_cache, so a pytest run could still leave a cache in the
      packaged tree and fail the lintian check the strip exists to prevent.
    - Test gains a .pytest_cache fixture and removal assertion.

