commit a052aef95a57f9f19b23857c92f5ca5cb4e1b2b0
Author: claude (dev22 c20093f1-1b30-4397-87b6-9586321c87df) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Sun Jun 28 13:15:13 2026 -0400

    fix: tolower only the tarball file name, not DISTDIR

    make_get_variables lowercased the WHOLE make_debian_tarball /
    make_upstream_tarball_relative_path strings, DISTDIR included:

      make_debian_tarball="${make_debian_tarball,,}"

    The package name must be lowercase, but DISTDIR must not be touched. When
    DISTDIR contained any uppercase character the lowercased parent no longer
    existed and the immediately following

      realpath -- "$make_debian_tarball"

    aborted the build with "No such file or directory". Real build DISTDIRs
    are lowercase so it never bit in practice, but any uppercase DISTDIR
    (e.g. a mktemp -d path) broke every version-info target.

    Lowercase only the file name and re-prefix the untouched DISTDIR, exactly
    as the non-tolower branch already builds the path.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018bezwAzE9uxSX1xrH7okFV

commit 97ec64930352fb231bd809407db571d559dd6bba
Author: claude (dev22 c20093f1-1b30-4397-87b6-9586321c87df) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Sun Jun 28 11:42:54 2026 -0400

    fix: deb-cleanup/reprepro-remove/reprepro-add need make_get_variables, not just dependencies

    Commits 367298e (deb-cleanup) and 4283612 (reprepro-remove, reprepro-add)
    added these targets to the __needs_dependencies group, which calls only
    make_get_dependencies and skips make_get_variables. But all three depend on
    variables that only make_get_variables sets:

      - make_deb_cleanup -> make_undist/make_undebdist/make_undebdsc/make_deb_clean
        use make_upstream_tarball_relative_path, make_debian_tarball_absolute_path,
        make_main_dsc_file and make_package_list.
      - make_reprepro_shared uses make_main_changes_file and make_package_list.

    Running e.g. 'genmkfile deb-cleanup' therefore aborted with:
      make_upstream_tarball_relative_path: unbound variable

    None of these targets reference any dependency-only variable, and
    make_get_variables itself runs make_get_dependencies when needed, so the fix
    is simply to let them fall through to the version-info default. Only
    deb-build-dep/deb-run-dep/deb-all-dep are genuinely dependencies-only.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018bezwAzE9uxSX1xrH7okFV

