commit 7b9e6b13d11d98b9623ce9e16b2db02b5a6d6bac
Author: Patrick Schleizer <adrelanos@riseup.net>
Date:   Fri Apr 24 03:04:12 2015 +0000

    updated genmkfile Makefile to version 1.6 - https://phabricator.whonix.org/T271
    - `include`ing of makefile-full can now be avoided by setting environment variable GENMKFILE_INCLUDE_FILE_MAIN to 0
    - improved code to bootstrap genmkfile
    - new environment variables GENMKFILE_INCLUDE_FILE_PRE and GENMKFILE_INCLUDE_FILE_POST that can be used to `include` make files before and after optionally `include`ing GENMKFILE_INCLUDE_FILE_MAIN
    - show GENMKFILE_CURRENT in new "make about" target
    Thanks to @nrgaway for advice with make.

